// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2224861664" "It's an interesting fact that Cole's main method of policing the people of Praetoria has led us to discover the location of this all important bomb. Much like all tyrants in history, Cole's main weakness is his grip of control over the people.<br><br>This was something I tried desperately to teach my students, in the final days of my teaching. I was forced out, you know. I did not leave on my own volition; Cole and his forces threatened the well-being of my family and friends if I did not stop spreading my 'lies' to the children that I taught. Instead of continuing a career teaching lies to the children, I left my job. I went home that night to find my home empty. It seems Cole did not 'approve' of my choice. The reports say my family was sent away to another country, claiming they wanted to go there to aid them.<br><br>That was over five years ago, {HeroName}. I know that my family is dead. Perhaps that is why in these final moments, I am calm."
// RandomFameString :
"P3958075051" "string"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Radio 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P351272043" "There's going to be a series of dialogs here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2556992822" "Our allies in the Syndicate have been most helpful to our cause. Unfortunately for them, I know how the Syndicate operates. Now that we have the location of the bomb, they will try to take the bomb for themselves. It is unfortunate, but it is the nature of their dealings. Kirchmer, I know, will betray me. It will not be the first time a former student of mine has betrayed me, nor will it be the first time that I will have to kill a former student of mine. Such is the life that good men are forced to live in these times.<br><br>It is a dirty business, {HeroName}, but I must ask you to eliminate those members of the Syndicate who we once called allies, along with their contact, a man named Vincent Soto."
// AcceptString :
"P495184854" "They'll have to be taken down if they intend to betray us first, right?"
// SendOffString :
"P3877033559" "Right.<br><br>I believe they move now through the tunnels, of all places. I have it on good authority that they bring with them <color yellow>proximity bombs</color>. They intend to use them to blow up our main route in and out of the tunnels. An interesting notion, but they believed they were dealing with a fool. I strongly prescribe to the notion that those who do not know history will be doomed to repeat it. I know quite well how all historical dealings with organizations such as the Syndicate have gone, and I will not see us fail because of their greed."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2677414008" "Eliminate the Syndicate Traitors"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3590623052" "Do not spare any expense on them, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2166120153" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Loose Ends</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3850976950" "The Syndicate would seek to use the Neutron bomb for their own ends - you'll have to make sure that doesn't happen."

