// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3787840939" "You've wiped out your former allies in the Syndicate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P846644722" "Excellent work, {HeroName}. That was the last loose end that we have. We can move forward now with our plan of attack to retrieve the bomb.<br><br>Kirchmer was the second student I've had killed. The first was a PPD officer, a man named Stewart Tones. I knew him very well, he was one of my most intelligent students. I did not want to kill him, {HeroName}, but it was either him, or me. I pleaded with the boy to walk away, but he insisted he was 'serving the good of Praetoria'. After all I taught him, he <i>still</i> had that naive, ignorant view. I shot him in the head before he could shoot me. I truly believe that on that day, whoever I once was died.<br><br>I apologize for going on at length about this, {HeroName}, but I feel someone must know of my past, of my history. I do not intend to live through this plan; I cannot die without at least one person learning from what I've gone through."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1768591469" "{HeroName}! What's going on?! There's chaos everywhere! Diseased Resistance in the precincts, ghouls in the streets, it's mass chaos!"
// Answer Text :
"P3681073021" "(Tell Marchand Wardog's plan)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P884854463" "The Neutron bomb! That's insane! {HeroName}, I did not even know one of those was being <i>made</i>! If that goes off in Nova Praetoria, <i>every single person on the island will die!</i> But I fear for what would happen if we allow this to stay in the hands of Neuron. I believe he has commandeered part of my PPD force. This is something that I <i>cannot</i> stand for."
// Answer Text :
"P2308407966" "So, what should we do?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3465116373" "You'll have to go along with the Resistance, for now. Retrieve the Neutron bomb, but keep me posted on it. Whatever you do, <i>do not let the Resistance activate it!</i> It may actually be safer <i>out</i> of Neuron's hands than it would be in it. Contact me again when you know that the next move is going to be on Wardog's end."
// Answer Text :
"P2868661889" "Will do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1968106462" "The climax of our actions is soon approaching. Vagabond and Hatchet are prepared for our assault on the lab that has our Neutron bomb. The PPD are unaware that we are on our way, though I assume that they are already well guarded. Our efforts, however, are coordinated. <br><br>As we speak, the diseased members of the Resistance have activated in precincts all over Nova and Imperial, sending them into chaos. The officers in the lab will be unable to move in to provide back up. Beholder's seers have launched various attacks on the Seers in Imperial to prevent Tilman from seeing our attack. Hatchet's small army of ghouls have moved to the surface in Neutropolis and Imperial, ensuring that the PPD must take them out before dealing with us."
// AcceptString :
"P96316595" "All that's left is for us to get the bomb."
// SendOffString :
"P3794437079" "The last and most important step. This not a time for words anymore, {HeroName}. This is a time for action! I will meet you at the lab.<br><br><color yellow>Those Loyalists who have gone undercover would do well to speak with Provost Marchand about events that are happening.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3755354332" "Retrieve the Neutron Bomb"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2258684234" "You haven't left yet? Let's get moving!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3191155747" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Mutually Assured Destruction</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
